*Dance for fitness and community*

## Why women love our Afro Dance Fitness classes

Each class starts with a warm-up and cardio fitness. Then we learn a choreography together, step by step. Meanwhile, our drummers play live, so the energy stays high from start to finish.

However, this class is about much more than exercise. It’s also a place to laugh, connect with other women and feel the joy of moving to African rhythms. As a result, you’ll leave each class feeling energised, connected and happy.

{% testimonials %}
{% testimonial name="Bec" role="African dance teacher" %}
In Africa, drumming and dancing are a part of everyday life. The music and rhythmic movements bring community together. It creates pure joy.
{% /testimonial %}
{% /testimonials %}
{% /column %}

