## Afro Dance Fitness classes at a glance

- **When:** Tuesdays, 6.30pm to 7.30pm
- **Where:** Palmwoods Memorial Hall, 1 Main St, Palmwoods QLD 4555
- **Who:** Women of all fitness levels
- **Experience:** None needed, because we teach every move step by step
- **New students:** $50 for your first 4 classes
- **Passes:** 4-class pass $80 · casual class $25, all in our [online shop](/shop/)
- **Bring:** Comfortable clothes and a water bottle

Want to drum too? Then join our [African drumming class](/african-drumming-classes/) at 5.30pm first. You can also [see all our classes](/classes/), or read more about [West African music](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Music_of_West_Africa) on Wikipedia.
