## Afro Dance Fitness classes FAQs

{% faq %}
{% question title="Do I need any dance experience?" %}
Not at all. Our Afro Dance Fitness classes welcome complete beginners. In fact, we break every routine down step by step, so you’ll be dancing in no time.
{% /question %}

{% question title="Who are the classes for?" %}
We designed this class especially for women who want to get fit, have fun and meet new people.
{% /question %}

{% question title="Do I need to be fit to join?" %}
Not at all. All fitness levels are welcome, so you can work at your own pace and build up over time.
{% /question %}

{% question title="What should I wear and bring?" %}
First, wear comfortable clothes that you can move in. Also bring a water bottle, because the class gets your heart pumping!
{% /question %}

{% question title="Is the drumming really live?" %}
Yes. Our drummers play live West African rhythms every class, so the music lifts the dancers and the energy stays high.
{% /question %}
{% /faq %}
{% /section %}

